{"parentUuid":"03636190-0f49-44e1-92a9-7f4d024f0ae5","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgknmpCdAapHyEyyJhZ7L","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Use the app built in this branch's worktree. It was built at 15:45 and includes the import fix. Give it a data folder that sits next to a copy of your OrcaSlicer folder. The app looks for OrcaSlicer next to its own data folder. That's why your last run with `--datadir ~/JusPrinStagingTest` went straight to the manual printer form: the app looked for `~/OrcaSlicer`, which doesn't exist.\n\nThis command makes a fresh test folder, copies your OrcaSlicer folder into it (226 MB, and your real folder isn't touched), and starts the app against staging from the Welcome screen:\n\n```bash\nrm -rf ~/JusPrinStg && mkdir -p ~/JusPrinStg && ditto ~/Library/Application\\ Support/OrcaSlicer ~/JusPrinStg/OrcaSlicer && JUSPRIN_AGENT_ENDPOINT=https://jusprinv2-stg.obico.io/ent/jusprin/v2/responses /Users/kenneth/Projects/JusPrin/.claude/worktrees/first-run-flow-f7be35/build/arm64/src/RelWithDebInfo/OrcaSlicer.app/Contents/MacOS/OrcaSlicer --datadir ~/JusPrinStg/JusPrin2\n```\n\nWhat you should see:\n\n- After the Welcome screen, the import screen lists your 8 OrcaSlicer printers. Importing takes about 20 seconds, and the screen doesn't move during that time.\n- The import result screen should say all 8 printers and 3 filaments were imported. Home then shows 8 printer cards with the P1S selected.\n- To get the manual printer form instead, click \"Start fresh\" on the import screen.\n- To repeat from the start, run the same command again. The `rm -rf` at the front wipes only `~/JusPrinStg`.\n\nA few notes:\n\n- **No v1 import:** a run with `--datadir` never reads your real v1 JusPrin folder. You won't get a v1 import unless you set `JUSPRIN_V1_DATADIR`.\n- **Sign-in goes to staging:** it opens jusprinv2-stg.obico.io in your browser, and staging sends real emails. Use a `k+something@obico.io` address for email sign-in.\n- **Not tested against staging:** I ran this build only against my local fake server, never against staging."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":987,"cache_read_input_tokens":139754,"output_tokens":1509,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":710},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":987,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1509,"cache_read_input_tokens":139754,"cache_creation_input_tokens":987,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":987},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgknmoyiiCreowGYDy83P","requestRef":"aa29f385-d09a-4091-8a6f-d3a7ccfc6f2b","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"da1b00b4-7df6-4682-9e3f-27160032ed0a","timestamp":"2026-11-06T01:15:58.240Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/kenneth/Projects/JusPrin/.claude/worktrees/first-run-flow-f7be35","sessionId":"c868826d-3950-4f0f-9ecd-4a549cdd6983","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"claude/first-run-printer-step","slug":"dapper-knitting-moler"}
