{"type":"api-request","sessionId":"c868826d-3950-4f0f-9ecd-4a549cdd6983","id":"cc9394a8-646d-4ce5-ba23-a1a39d0d74c3","timestamp":"2026-11-06T04:32:24.661Z","version":"2.1.309","querySource":"sdk","shapeHash":"6be4cbcf13bd24f91c1084271e54c66443d4511e9a00e5bc8042b89ce33d2e34","params":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","betas":["claude-code-20250219","oauth-2025-04-20","interleaved-thinking-2025-05-14","thinking-token-count-2026-05-13","context-management-2025-06-27","prompt-caching-scope-2026-01-05","per-turn-control-2026-07-01","mid-conversation-tool-changes-2026-07-01","inline-tools-2026-09-15","advisor-tool-2026-03-01","advanced-tool-use-2025-11-20","mid-conversation-system-clear-at-2026-08-21","effort-2025-11-24","thinking-binding-controls-2026-08-01","thinking-display-updates-2026-08-18","extended-cache-ttl-2025-04-11","cache-diagnosis-2026-04-07","message-threads-2026-08-12"],"max_tokens":128000,"thinking":{"type":"adaptive","display":"updates"},"context_management":{"edits":[{"type":"clear_thinking_20251015","keep":"all"}]},"output_config":{"effort":"high"}},"base":"45d4902a-b419-48d6-b14a-36ebac0cb120","keep":431,"tail":["b4a7db8ffefe9871cc3ae2b0d9ad40e24a8890d77f6f341622dcbf19eae4e6d7","6f7746b10b24a8b9737d8bd61bdfe91effec972996c65db93d4f2b4336680385","8d5417819870814c986d7076932ad2dcad28287bdd05a674772b4c6ce5fb42e5"],"cacheControl":[{"path":["system",1],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h","scope":"global"}},{"path":["system",2],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}},{"path":["messages",433,"content",0],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}}],"requestDigest":"b2240fd3e61c2f30b1c7e3466004268eccef400b3e3db12c6434f05f616e0ff0"}
{"parentUuid":"717a5627-4ca7-4171-aaaa-5d48d72a2b17","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgm3mwDYf3HtAqMy79ewj","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I ran it again with the screen unlocked. The import is about twice as fast as before, but the \"Importing…\" label still doesn't appear on screen while it runs. So that part of commit 242a9e73ba doesn't work, and the commit message is wrong where it says both screens showed the label.\n\n**Timing with the screen unlocked**\n- **First-launch import:** I ran the Printers step's Import on a fresh data folder twice. Both runs took 21.5 seconds. The old code took 46 seconds on the same folder this afternoon, also unlocked.\n- **Menu import of 8 printers:** one run took 12.6 seconds. A second took 21.4 seconds, while another session's work pushed the machine's load from about 3 to 8. The result screen was correct: \"They are in the printer menu. The printer this project uses didn't change.\"\n\n**The \"Importing…\" label**\n- I clicked Import and took screenshots 1, 7 and 15 seconds later, while the import was running. All three still show \"Import\".\n- In a second run I read the button from inside the page every half second. It said \"Importing…\" for the whole import.\n- So the page draws the label, but it never reaches the screen. The app's main thread has to put the web page's new frame on screen, and it starts the import before doing that. The page sends its request about a millisecond after the click, which leaves no time.\n- My earlier check only read the page's markup. That's why I wrongly reported this as working.\n- The menu dialog sends its request the same way. I haven't looked at its screen, so I'm assuming it has the same problem.\n\n**The fix I want to try:** make the page wait two frames plus 50 milliseconds before sending the request. During that pause the app's main thread is free to put the label on screen. I've made that change in my test copy of the Home page but haven't tested it yet. Only a screenshot taken during the import can show whether it works. The system screenshot tool has no permission here, and the background window capture waits until the app is free, which is after the import. So I need full-screen control, and neither of my two requests for it was answered.\n\nNothing new is committed. The branch is still at 242a9e73ba, unpushed."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":489,"cache_read_input_tokens":318733,"output_tokens":687,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":489,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":687,"cache_read_input_tokens":318733,"cache_creation_input_tokens":489,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":489},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Cgm3mvxR15MC4ikuqG1z4","requestRef":"cc9394a8-646d-4ce5-ba23-a1a39d0d74c3","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","attributionMcpServer":"ccd_turn","attributionMcpTool":"wrap_up","type":"assistant","uuid":"d3192ed8-66c2-4d81-a6af-f247cd9dc914","timestamp":"2026-11-06T04:32:32.034Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/private/tmp/claude/claude-502/-Users-kenneth-Projects-JusPrin--claude-worktrees-first-run-flow-f7be35/c868826d-3950-4f0f-9ecd-4a549cdd6983/scratchpad/pstep/dev","sessionId":"c868826d-3950-4f0f-9ecd-4a549cdd6983","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"claude/orca-import-menu","slug":"dapper-knitting-moler"}
