{"parentUuid":"373a7bd1-48ca-429f-be11-b0a29e1860bd","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"8cccf504-d1e9-4545-a59f-bb696ece55d3","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01UbhZxdRgVivtdSfAiUyW5t","type":"tool_result","content":"---\nname: restore-temp-edits-from-a-copy\ndescription: \"After a temporary edit to prove a test fails, restore from a saved copy, never `git checkout <file>` — it also wipes your uncommitted work in that file.\"\nmetadata:\n  node_type: memory\n  type: feedback\n  originSessionId: 79e5592f-78a2-4530-83b6-126f25ab0a8d\n  modified: 2026-10-18T00:23:11.256Z\n---\n\n2026-10-17: to prove a page test fails, I added a line to projectInstructions.ts and restored with `git checkout`; that reverted my uncommitted deletion too, and only `git diff --stat` showing nothing caught it.\n\n**Why:** the file's committed state is not the state before the temporary edit when the work is uncommitted.\n**How to apply:** `cp file scratch/file.keep` before the injection and `cp` it back, then check `git diff` still shows the intended change. Related: [[prove-guard-tests-fail-first]].","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"d703fddf-b4a0-448b-8aa0-a333a0806074","timestamp":"2026-11-06T05:14:22.465Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"---\nname: restore-temp-edits-from-a-copy\ndescription: \"After a temporary edit to prove a test fails, restore from a saved copy, never `git checkout <file>` — it also wipes your uncommitted work in that file.\"\nmetadata:\n  node_type: memory\n  type: feedback\n  originSessionId: 79e5592f-78a2-4530-83b6-126f25ab0a8d\n  modified: 2026-10-18T00:23:11.256Z\n---\n\n2026-10-17: to prove a page test fails, I added a line to projectInstructions.ts and restored with `git checkout`; that reverted my uncommitted deletion too, and only `git diff --stat` showing nothing caught it.\n\n**Why:** the file's committed state is not the state before the temporary edit when the work is uncommitted.\n**How to apply:** `cp file scratch/file.keep` before the injection and `cp` it back, then check `git diff` still shows the intended change. Related: [[prove-guard-tests-fail-first]].","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"373a7bd1-48ca-429f-be11-b0a29e1860bd","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/kenneth/.claude/projects/-Users-kenneth-Projects-JusPrin/memory","sessionId":"c868826d-3950-4f0f-9ecd-4a549cdd6983","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"claude/orca-import-menu","slug":"dapper-knitting-moler"}
