{"parentUuid":"d5921914-a05c-4861-9ab5-05a613053cf8","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"0dfadd55-eca4-4130-a1f1-77ada912a567","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01PxCMmEFqmqr6vUu2FVk4D5","type":"tool_result","content":"ee9c0c926e220a3382e28feea3932be2237d35d3\nexit 0\n M resources/jusprin/ui/design-tokens.json\n M src/slic3r/GUI/JusPrin/Agent/AgentConfiguration.hpp\n M src/slic3r/GUI/JusPrin/Agent/AgentHost.cpp\n M src/slic3r/GUI/JusPrin/Agent/AgentHost.hpp\n M src/slic3r/GUI/JusPrin/Agent/AgentWebView.cpp\n M src/slic3r/GUI/JusPrin/Agent/ProviderAgent.cpp\n M src/slic3r/GUI/JusPrin/Agent/ProviderAgent.hpp\n M src/slic3r/GUI/JusPrin/AgentUI/src/PreferencesApp.test.tsx\n M src/slic3r/GUI/JusPrin/AgentUI/src/PreferencesApp.tsx\n M src/slic3r/GUI/JusPrin/AgentUI/src/bridge/protocol.ts\n M src/slic3r/GUI/JusPrin/AgentUI/src/components/BalancePanel.test.tsx\n M src/slic3r/GUI/JusPrin/AgentUI/src/components/Composer.credits.test.tsx\n M src/slic3r/GUI/JusPrin/AgentUI/src/components/Preferences.tsx\n M src/slic3r/GUI/JusPrin/AgentUI/src/credits.ts\n M src/slic3r/GUI/JusPrin/AgentUI/src/state/store.ts\n M src/slic3r/GUI/JusPrin/AgentUI/src/styles.css\n M src/slic3r/GUI/JusPrin/Preferences/PreferencesWindow.cpp\n M tests/agent/test_agent_bridge.cpp\n M tests/brand/test_brand_tokens.cpp\n?? design-captures/\n9e07257c2c Printer chat: end a finished setup with a Done button that closes the chat\n  type: feedback\n---\n\nOn 2026-10-08 a session running in `.claude/worktrees/<name>` tried to write a report next to its handoff in `/Users/kenneth/Projects/JusPrin/` and the Write tool was refused by a hook: edits to the base checkout \"do not land on this session's branch and may corrupt the user's primary working copy\". Bash `cp` is not stopped by the hook, but that is working around a deliberate guard, so anything copied there was moved back.\n\n**Why:** handoffs are read from the main checkout ([[handoff-docs-not-committed]]), which makes it tempting to hand the report back in the same place.\n\n**How to apply:** write reports and evidence folders in the worktree root, leave them untracked ([[temp-docs-stay-untracked-and-visible]]), and give Kenneth the worktree path. Never use the scratchpad for a deliverable; the app's file pane cannot open it as part of the project.","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"3789bf24-db05-4006-b12f-4ce053a9e300","timestamp":"2026-11-06T06:04:31.075Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"ee9c0c926e220a3382e28feea3932be2237d35d3\nexit 0\n M resources/jusprin/ui/design-tokens.json\n M src/slic3r/GUI/JusPrin/Agent/AgentConfiguration.hpp\n M src/slic3r/GUI/JusPrin/Agent/AgentHost.cpp\n M src/slic3r/GUI/JusPrin/Agent/AgentHost.hpp\n M src/slic3r/GUI/JusPrin/Agent/AgentWebView.cpp\n M src/slic3r/GUI/JusPrin/Agent/ProviderAgent.cpp\n M src/slic3r/GUI/JusPrin/Agent/ProviderAgent.hpp\n M src/slic3r/GUI/JusPrin/AgentUI/src/PreferencesApp.test.tsx\n M src/slic3r/GUI/JusPrin/AgentUI/src/PreferencesApp.tsx\n M src/slic3r/GUI/JusPrin/AgentUI/src/bridge/protocol.ts\n M src/slic3r/GUI/JusPrin/AgentUI/src/components/BalancePanel.test.tsx\n M src/slic3r/GUI/JusPrin/AgentUI/src/components/Composer.credits.test.tsx\n M src/slic3r/GUI/JusPrin/AgentUI/src/components/Preferences.tsx\n M src/slic3r/GUI/JusPrin/AgentUI/src/credits.ts\n M src/slic3r/GUI/JusPrin/AgentUI/src/state/store.ts\n M src/slic3r/GUI/JusPrin/AgentUI/src/styles.css\n M src/slic3r/GUI/JusPrin/Preferences/PreferencesWindow.cpp\n M tests/agent/test_agent_bridge.cpp\n M tests/brand/test_brand_tokens.cpp\n?? design-captures/\n9e07257c2c Printer chat: end a finished setup with a Done button that closes the chat\n  type: feedback\n---\n\nOn 2026-10-08 a session running in `.claude/worktrees/<name>` tried to write a report next to its handoff in `/Users/kenneth/Projects/JusPrin/` and the Write tool was refused by a hook: edits to the base checkout \"do not land on this session's branch and may corrupt the user's primary working copy\". Bash `cp` is not stopped by the hook, but that is working around a deliberate guard, so anything copied there was moved back.\n\n**Why:** handoffs are read from the main checkout ([[handoff-docs-not-committed]]), which makes it tempting to hand the report back in the same place.\n\n**How to apply:** write reports and evidence folders in the worktree root, leave them untracked ([[temp-docs-stay-untracked-and-visible]]), and give Kenneth the worktree path. Never use the scratchpad for a deliverable; the app's file pane cannot open it as part of the project.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"d5921914-a05c-4861-9ab5-05a613053cf8","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/kenneth/Projects/JusPrin/.claude/worktrees/first-run-flow-f7be35","sessionId":"c868826d-3950-4f0f-9ecd-4a549cdd6983","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"claude/orca-import-menu","slug":"dapper-knitting-moler"}
