{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"c868826d-3950-4f0f-9ecd-4a549cdd6983","hash":"134fb0c17437c3308d183bec79c51b1ab20264e615bcfab9398e9b20fbb95d5c","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"Writing the two pure functions and their declarations."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_014Sv68smaiXjv9gTn8Ln4Gw","name":"Edit","input":{"file_path":"/Users/kenneth/Projects/JusPrin/.claude/worktrees/first-run-flow-f7be35/src/slic3r/GUI/JusPrin/Home/OrcaImport.hpp","old_string":"std::vector<std::string> orca_printer_bases(const std::vector<std::string>& files);\n","new_string":"std::vector<std::string> orca_printer_bases(const std::vector<std::string>& files);\n\n// What an import brings when the person leaves some printers unchosen:\n// `printers` names the chosen ones as the import screen lists them, a saved\n// printer by its file's name and a printer from JusPrin's own profile by the\n// profile's name. Every filament and process file comes along whichever\n// printers are chosen.\nstruct OrcaImportChoice\n{\n    std::vector<OrcaImportItem> profile_printers;\n    std::vector<std::string>    files;\n};\nOrcaImportChoice orca_import_chosen(const OrcaPresetFiles& presets, const std::vector<OrcaImportItem>& profile_printers,\n                                    const std::vector<std::string>& printers);\n\n// Bringing this item again can succeed: a file that couldn't be read, or a\n// preset or profile JusPrin couldn't load. A file with no version or of no\n// known kind, or one built on a base JusPrin doesn't have, fails the same\n// way every time.\nbool orca_import_retryable(const OrcaImportItem& item);\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_011vTFbmaFixSKMP2sDwALvD","name":"Edit","input":{"file_path":"/Users/kenneth/Projects/JusPrin/.claude/worktrees/first-run-flow-f7be35/src/slic3r/GUI/JusPrin/Home/OrcaImport.cpp","old_string":"std::vector<OrcaTickedPrinter> orca_ticked_printers(const fs::path& orca_root)","new_string":"OrcaImportChoice orca_import_chosen(const OrcaPresetFiles& presets, const std::vector<OrcaImportItem>& profile_printers,\n                                    const std::vector<std::string>& printers)\n{\n    const auto chosen = [&printers](const std::string& name) { return std::find(printers.begin(), printers.end(), name) != printers.end(); };\n    OrcaImportChoice choice;\n    for (const OrcaImportItem& item : profile_printers)\n        if (chosen(item.name))\n            choice.profile_printers.push_back(item);\n    // scan_orca_presets lists the printers' files first, in the order of their names.\n    for (std::size_t index = 0; index < presets.files.size(); ++index)\n        if (index >= presets.printers.size() || chosen(presets.printers[index]))\n            choice.files.push_back(presets.files[index]);\n    return choice;\n}\n\nbool orca_import_retryable(const OrcaImportItem& item)\n{\n    return item.outcome == Outcome::NotImported && (item.reason == Reason::Unreadable || item.reason == Reason::NotLoaded);\n}\n\nstd::vector<OrcaTickedPrinter> orca_ticked_printers(const fs::path& orca_root)"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
