{"parentUuid":"c0085f37-407e-42c6-92d6-640a3af3e157","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"4e98f1e7-49ff-445f-823b-aeedc91e43e5","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_015QCpDj7t5Zxw3vSq6eSo1P","type":"tool_result","content":"#!/bin/zsh\n# onbtime.sh : on the running first-launch app, leaves the welcome, presses Import, waits for the result, prints timings\nSP=${0:a:h}; S=$SP/pstep\nsleep 25\n$SP/hjs.sh \"[...document.querySelectorAll('button')].find(b=>b.innerText.trim()==='Just slice for now').click()\" >/dev/null\nsleep 5\nL=$(ls -t $S/onb/JusPrin/log/debug_* | head -1); date \"+click at:      %T\"\n$SP/hjs.sh \"[...document.querySelectorAll('button')].find(b=>b.innerText.trim()==='Import').click()\" >/dev/null\nfor i in $(seq 1 400); do /usr/bin/grep -aq \"machine select success, m_idx_selected [0-9]*, name Bambu Lab P1S, is_system 0\" \"$L\" && break; sleep 1; done\nsleep 20\n/usr/bin/grep -a \"Installing .* vendor bundles\" \"$L\" | cut -c18-33 | sed 's/^/install: /'\n/usr/bin/grep -a \"machine select success, m_idx_selected [0-9]*, name Bambu Lab P1S, is_system 0\" \"$L\" | tail -1 | cut -c18-33 | sed 's/^/P1S named:     /'\n/usr/bin/grep -a \"\" \"$L\" | tail -1 | cut -c18-33 | sed 's/^/log quiet at:  /'\nrm -f $S/dev/out.txt; $SP/hjs.sh \"fetch('http://127.0.0.1:8767/out',{method:'POST',body:document.querySelector('#root').innerText.slice(0,80)})\" >/dev/null; sleep 2; cat $S/dev/out.txt | head -3\ndoes not build the web pages. Also build `--target jusprin_web jusprin_catalogs`\n`BUILD_TESTS=ON` is required or the tests/ tree (workspace, shell targets) is\n--target <targets>`. wxWidgets 3.3 sources for API verification live under\nabsolute path. Also: `cmake --build --target <one_exe>` may relink against a\nstale lib without recompiling a changed .cpp in that lib — build the app target","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"680e8c2e-df68-4cfd-b7a2-19caafeab2cf","timestamp":"2026-11-06T06:28:00.482Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"#!/bin/zsh\n# 