bring/JusPrin: @obico.io \n/private/tmp/claude/claude-502/-Users-kenneth-Projects-JusPrin--claude-worktrees-first-run-flow-f7be35/c868826d-3950-4f0f-9ecd-4a549cdd6983/scratchpad/pstep/none/JusPrin: \n/private/tmp/claude/claude-502/-Users-kenneth-Projects-JusPrin--claude-worktrees-first-run-flow-f7be35/c868826d-3950-4f0f-9ecd-4a549cdd6983/scratchpad/pstep/onb/JusPrin: \n/private/tmp/claude/claude-502/-Users-kenneth-Projects-JusPrin--claude-worktrees-first-run-flow-f7be35/c868826d-3950-4f0f-9ecd-4a549cdd6983/scratchpad/pstep/pickD/JusPrin: @obico.io \n/private/tmp/claude/claude-502/-Users-kenneth-Projects-JusPrin--claude-worktrees-first-run-flow-f7be35/c868826d-3950-4f0f-9ecd-4a549cdd6983/scratchpad/pstep/real/JusPrin: @obico.io \n/private/tmp/claude/claude-502/-Users-kenneth-Projects-JusPrin--claude-worktrees-first-run-flow-f7be35/c868826d-3950-4f0f-9ecd-4a549cdd6983/scratchpad/pstep/realA/JusPrin: @obico.io \n/private/tmp/claude/claude-502/-Users-kenneth-Projects-JusPrin--claude-worktrees-first-run-flow-f7be35/c868826d-3950-4f0f-9ecd-4a549cdd6983/scratchpad/pstep/retryR/JusPrin: @obico.io \n/private/tmp/claude/claude-502/-Users-kenneth-Projects-JusPrin--claude-worktrees-first-run-flow-f7be35/c868826d-3950-4f0f-9ecd-4a549cdd6983/scratchpad/pstep/skipG/JusPrin: @obico.io \n/private/tmp/claude/claude-502/-Users-kenneth-Projects-JusPrin--claude-worktrees-first-run-flow-f7be35/c868826d-3950-4f0f-9ecd-4a549cdd6983/scratchpad/pstep/ticked/JusPrin: \n/private/tmp/claude/claude-502/-Users-kenneth-Projects-JusPrin--claude-worktrees-first-run-flow-f7be35/c868826d-3950-4f0f-9ecd-4a549cdd6983/scratchpad/pstep/v1J/JusPrin: \n/private/tmp/claude/claude-502/-Users-kenneth-Projects-JusPrin--claude-worktrees-first-run-flow-f7be35/c868826d-3950-4f0f-9ecd-4a549cdd6983/scratchpad/pstep/v1K/JusPrin: \n---\nname: real-app-signed-in-without-screen-control\ndescription: \"Drive the real app signed in to a local gateway through an injected page script; which conf keys, why a copied binary dies, and what still needs the screen.\"\nmetadata:\n  node_type: memory\n  type: reference\n  originSessionId: f57d8b7e-fd5a-4daf-9378-2e3d21342f7c\n  modified: 2026-11-02T13:45:04.141Z\n---\n\nBuilds on [[live-host-check-via-instrumented-dev-page]]; used 2026-11-02 when screen control of the app was denied.\n\n- Signed-in conf needs all of: `jusprin_agent.{provider=jusprin, jusprin_api_key, enabled=true, cloud_consent=true, jusprin_model_formats=<JSON id→format from GET /ent/jusprin/v2/models>}`, `jusprin_server.base_url`, `jusprin_onboarding.status=completed`. Without the formats the Agent says \"not set up\".\n- An installed printer is `\"models\":[{\"vendor\":\"Custom\",\"model\":\"Generic Klipper Printer\",\"nozzle_diameter\":\"0.4\"}]`, not `vendors`.\n- Kill the app before editing the conf. Replace a scratch binary with `rm` then `cp`: `cp` over a binary that has run gets the new process killed at launch.\n- `Contents/Resources` in the build is a symlink to the worktree. Replace it with a real folder of links before corrupting a resource, or the worktree gets corrupted.\n- Bringing the app forward triggers an account refresh, so to race the gateway (a real 402), change the ledger and send without refocusing.\n- Page text input: native value setter plus an `input` event. A modal Preferences window's page polls as `agent-preferences`.\n- A test preset needs a `version` field or import rejects it.\n- A compose recreate drops env set by a wrapper; check `JUSPRIN_MODEL_ALIASES` before any chat so only the fake upstream is reachable.\n\nStill needs the screen: pointer hover, native file dialogs, Orca's wizard.","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"842a50a9-6849-477a-84f3-087869c6ce7e","timestamp":"2026-11-06T06:28:43.923Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"/private/tmp/claude/claude-502/-Users-kenneth-Projects-JusPrin--claude-worktrees-first-run-flow-f7be35/c868826d-3950-4f0f-9ecd-4a549cdd6983/scratchpad/pstep/addE/JusPrin: \n/private/tmp/claude/claude-502/-Users-kenneth-Projects-J