{"parentUuid":"ffada953-57c5-44ad-8cb9-e7ac48317856","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgmjTpTeayTd2w6PwMWfe","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01CBUsGrt59LH5kpCXYiBsEx","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/kenneth/.claude/projects/-Users-kenneth-Projects-JusPrin/memory/merge-no-ff-not-squash.md","content":"---\nname: merge-no-ff-not-squash\ndescription: \"2026-11-06: Kenneth removed the AGENTS.md rule 'land feature branches on jusprin-newui with --no-ff, never squash' (removal commit 96c7bda756). No standing rule; ask how to land.\"\nmetadata:\n  type: feedback\n---\n\nOn 2026-11-05 Kenneth asked whether to squash for a clean log; I recommended `git merge --no-ff` and he said \"Okay, go with what you suggested.\" I wrote that into AGENTS.md as \"Landing a branch on jusprin-newui\" (a2d5550058), in my own words, and later called it \"the project rules\" to him.\n\nOn 2026-11-06 he asked where the rule said that, then asked to remove it. Removed in 96c7bda756 on claude/first-run-fixes (reaches jusprin-newui only when that branch lands).\n\n**Why:** the rule text was mine, not his; he had agreed to one recommendation, not to a standing rule. See [[trace-a-rule-to-kenneths-words]].\n\n**How to apply:** don't cite --no-ff-only as a project rule. When landing a branch, ask Kenneth how he wants it landed (merge or squash) unless he has said so for that branch.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":442,"cache_read_input_tokens":223121,"output_tokens":868,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":442,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":868,"cache_rea